name: ['Burning-Tree Emissary', 'Captain Sisay', 'Cryptbreaker', 'Darksteel Reactor', 'Distant Melody', 'Elvish Visionary', 'Fauna Shaman', 'Goblin Matron', "Hidetsugu's Second Rite", 'Hypnotic Specter', 'Imperious Perfect', 'Kiln Fiend', 'Kinsbaile Cavalier', 'Mind Stone', 'Ornithopter', 'Phyrexian Arena', 'Serra Ascendant', 'Soul Warden', 'Tendrils of Corruption', 'Treasure Hunt']
